e runs can be graded and compared later. It lives in\n`~/evals/agent-evals` on the eval Mac.\n\n`./run.sh <task> <lane> [rep]` copies `tasks/<task>/` into a scratch folder in\n`/tmp`, runs the lane's agent there with `tasks/<task>.prompt`, and writes the\nrun folder `runs/<task>-<lane>-r<rep>/`:\n\n- `prompt.txt`, `agent.log` (the agent's JSON event stream), `agent.err`,\n  `meta.json` (exit code, seconds);\n- `final.txt`, the agent's last message, for the Codex lanes;\n- `answer.json`, written by `check_answer.py`: the final answer the graders\n  read (from `final.txt` for Codex, from the event stream for Kimi).\n\nLanes:\n\n- `codex`: Codex CLI (`codex exec --json`), unsandboxed.\n- `kimi`: Kimi Code. Its output goes to Moonshot, so its shell runs under the\n  macOS sandbox profile `sandbox/agent.sb` (no reading or writing the real\n  home), with an empty scratch HOME. Kimi's own install and sessions live in\n  `~/.kimi-code`, which the profile opens.\n\nCodex logs in with an API key from the environment (`CODEX_API_KEY`), so it\nneeds nothing from the home folder.\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":17,"oldLines":10,"newStart":17,"newLines":17,"lines":[" Lanes:"," "," - `codex`: Codex CLI (`codex exec --json`), unsandboxed.","+- `codex-sandboxed`: the same Codex run, but its shell runs under","+  `sandbox/agent.sb` with an empty scratch HOME (`CODEX_HOME` inside it), so","+  the agent cannot read or write the real home. Codex's own login","+  (`~/.codex/auth.json`) is in the real home and is therefore out of reach, so","+  this lane needs `CODEX_API_KEY` or `CODEX_ACCESS_TOKEN` set in the","+  environment; it exits with an error (recorded in `meta.json`) if neither is","+  set. Codex's `config.toml` is not read in this lane either."," - `kimi`: Kimi Code. Its output goes to Moonshot, so its shell runs under the","   macOS sandbox profile `sandbox/agent.sb` (no reading or writing the real","   home), with an empty scratch HOME. Kimi's own install and sessions live in","   `~/.kimi-code`, which the profile opens."," ","-Codex logs in with an API key from the environment (`CODEX_API_KEY`), so it","-needs nothing from the home folder.","+The `codex` lane needs nothing from the home folder beyond its own login","+(`~/.codex`), which it reads unsandboxed."]}],"userModified":false,"replaceAll":false,"contentNotInModelContext":true},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_0189nSbGunPtzpZE9jdCmz95","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
